<div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Chemistry_2e_(OpenStax)/01:_Essential_Ideas/1.06:_Mathematical_Treatment_of_Measurement_Results" class="mt-section"><span id="Exercise_.5C(.5CPageIndex.7B1.7D.5C)_3"></span><h5 class="box-legend lt-chem-414599 editable"><span class="lt-icon-default">Exercise \(\PageIndex{1}\)</span></h5>

<p class="lt-chem-414599">Convert 50 &deg;F to &deg;C and K.</p>

<dl>
